msgid "COS(0) equals 1.0"
msgstr "Cos(0) gelyk aan 1.0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1865
msgid "COS(PI()/2) equals 0"
msgstr "Cos(Pi()/2) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1867
msgid "The SIN() function returns the sine of x, where x is given in radians."
msgstr "Die Sin() funksie gee terug Die skyn van x, waar x is gegewe in radiale."

#: xml_doc.cc:1868
msgid "SIN(Float)"
msgstr "Sin(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1869
msgid "SIN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "Sin(0) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1870
msgid "SIN(PI()/2) equals 1"
msgstr "Sin(Pi()/2) gelyk aan 1"

#: xml_doc.cc:1872
msgid "The TAN() function returns the tangent of x, where x is given in radians."
msgstr "Die Tan() funksie gee terug Die tangent van x, waar x is gegewe in radiale."

#: xml_doc.cc:1873
msgid "TAN(Float)"
msgstr "Tan(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1874
msgid "TAN(0.7) equals 0.84228838"
msgstr "Tan(0.7) gelyk aan 0.84228838"

#: xml_doc.cc:1875
msgid "TAN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "Tan(0) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1877
msgid ""
"The ACOS() function returns the arc cosine in radians and the value is "
"mathematically defined to be 0 to PI (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Die Acos() funksie gee terug Die boog kosinus in radiale en Die waarde is "
"wiskundig gedefinieër na wees 0 na Pi (insluitend)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1878
msgid "ACOS(Float)"
msgstr "Acos(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1879
msgid "ACOS(0.8) equals 0.6435011"
msgstr "Acos(0.8) gelyk aan 0.6435011"

#: xml_doc.cc:1880
msgid "ACOS(0) equals 1.57079633"
msgstr "Acos(0) gelyk aan 1.57079633"

#: xml_doc.cc:1882
msgid ""
"The ASIN() function returns the arc sine in radians and the value is "
"mathematically defined to be -PI/2 to PI/2 (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Die Asin() funksie gee terug Die boog skyn in radiale en Die waarde is "
"wiskundig gedefinieër na wees -Pi/2 na Pi/2 (insluitend)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1883
msgid "ASIN(Float)"
msgstr "Asin(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1884
msgid "ASIN(0.8) equals 0.92729522"
msgstr "Asin(0.8) gelyk aan 0.92729522"

#: xml_doc.cc:1885
msgid "ASIN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "Asin(0) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1887
msgid ""
"The ATAN() function returns the arc tangent in radians and the value is "
"mathematically defined to be -PI/2 to PI/2 (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Die Atan() funksie gee terug Die boog tangent in radiale en Die waarde is "
"wiskundig gedefinieër na wees -Pi/2 na Pi/2 (insluitend)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1888
msgid "ATAN(Float)"
msgstr "Atan(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1889
msgid "ATAN(0.8) equals 0.67474094"
msgstr "Atan(0.8) gelyk aan 0.67474094"

#: xml_doc.cc:1890
msgid "ATAN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "Atan(0) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1892
msgid ""
"The COSH() function returns the hyperbolic cosine of x, which is defined "
"mathematically as (exp(x) + exp(-x)) / 2."
msgstr ""
"Die Cosh() funksie gee terug Die hiperbolies kosinus van x, wat is "
"gedefinieër wiskundig as (exp(x) + exp(-x)) / 2."

#: xml_doc.cc:1893
msgid "COSH(Float)"
msgstr "Cosh(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1894
msgid "COSH(0.8) equals 1.33743495"
msgstr "Cosh(0.8) gelyk aan 1.33743495"

#: xml_doc.cc:1895
msgid "COSH(0) equals 1"
msgstr "Cosh(0) gelyk aan 1"

#: xml_doc.cc:1897
msgid ""
"The SINH() function returns the hyperbolic sine of x, which is defined "
"mathematically as (exp(x) - exp(-x)) / 2."
msgstr ""
"Die Sinh() funksie gee terug Die hiperbolies skyn van x, wat is gedefinieër "
"wiskundig as (exp(x) - exp(-x)) / 2."

#: xml_doc.cc:1898
msgid "SINH(Float)"
msgstr "Sinh(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1899
msgid "SINH(0.8) equals 0.88810598"
msgstr "Sinh(0.8) gelyk aan 0.88810598"

#: xml_doc.cc:1900
msgid "SINH(0) equals 0"
msgstr "Sinh(0) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1902
msgid ""
"The TANH() function returns the hyperbolic tangent of x, which is defined "
"mathematically as sinh(x)/cosh(x)."
msgstr ""
"Die Tanh() funksie gee terug Die hiperbolies tangent van x, wat is "
"gedefinieër wiskundig as sinh(x)/cosh(x)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1903
msgid "TANH(Float)"
msgstr "Tanh(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1904
msgid "TANH(0.8) equals 0.66403677"
msgstr "Tanh(0.8) gelyk aan 0.66403677"

#: xml_doc.cc:1905
msgid "TANH(0) equals 0"
msgstr "Tanh(0) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1907
msgid ""
"The ACOSH() function calculates the inverse hyperbolic cosine of x. That is "
"the value whose hyperbolic cosine is x. If x is less than 1.0, acosh() "
"returns not-a-number (NaN) and errno is set."
msgstr ""
"Die acosh() funksie bereken Die omgekeerde hiperbolies kosinus van x. Wat is "
"Die waarde wie se hiperbolies kosinus is x. As x is minder as 1.0, acosh() "
"gee terug not-a-number (Nan) en fout-nr is stel."

#: xml_doc.cc:1908
msgid "ACOSH(Float)"
msgstr "Acosh(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1909
msgid "ACOSH(5) equals 2.29243167"
msgstr "Acosh(5) gelyk aan 2.29243167"

#: xml_doc.cc:1910
msgid "ACOSH(0) equals NaN"
msgstr "Acosh(0) gelyk aan Nan"

#: xml_doc.cc:1912
msgid ""
"The ASINH() function calculates the inverse hyperbolic sine of x; that is "
"the value whose hyperbolic sine is x."
msgstr ""
"Die Asinh() funksie bereken Die omgekeerde hiperbolies skyn van x; wat is "
"Die waarde wie se hiperbolies skyn is x."

#: xml_doc.cc:1913
msgid "ASINH(Float)"
msgstr "Asinh(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1914
msgid "ASINH(0.8) equals 0.73266826"
msgstr "Asinh(0.8) gelyk aan 0.73266826"

#: xml_doc.cc:1915
msgid "ASINH(0) equals 0"
msgstr "Asinh(0) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1917
msgid ""
"The ATANH() function calculates the inverse hyperbolic tangent of x; that is "
"the value whose hyperbolic tangent is x. If the absolute value of x is "
"greater than 1.0, ATANH() returns not-a-number (NaN)."
msgstr ""
"Die Atanh() funksie bereken Die omgekeerde hiperbolies tangent van x; wat is "
"Die waarde wie se hiperbolies tangent is x. As Die absolute waarde van x is "
"grootter as 1.0, Atanh() gee terug not-a-number (Nan)."

#: xml_doc.cc:1918
msgid "ATANH(Float)"
msgstr "Atanh(Dryf)"

#: xml_doc.cc:1919
msgid "ATANH(0.8) equals 1.09861229"
msgstr "Atanh(0.8) gelyk aan 1.09861229"

#: xml_doc.cc:1920
msgid "ATANH(0) equals 0"
msgstr "Atanh(0) gelyk aan 0"

#: xml_doc.cc:1923
msgid ""
"This function calculates the arc tangent of the two variables x and y. It is "
"similar to calculating the arc tangent of y/x, except that the signs of both "
"arguments are used to determine the quadrant of the result."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie funksie bereken die boog tangent van die twee veranderlikes x en y. "
"Dit is soortgelyk na besig om te bereken die boog tangent van y/x, behalwe "
"wat die tekens van beide argumente word gebruik word na bepaal die kwadrant "
"van die resultaat."

#: xml_doc.cc:1924
msgid "ATAN2(value;value)"
msgstr "Atan2(waarde;waarde)"

